      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dawson%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The village sprang up in 1854 when the railroad reached the spot, marking Dawson’s birth as a rail town.",
