      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dawson%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Dawson sits just 10 miles east of Springfield, making it part of the state capital’s metropolitan area.",
